WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:07,450
Dahuang leads the way. I want to see what's going on.

2
00:00:07,450 --> 00:00:16,130
Far East storm

3
00:00:16,130 --> 00:00:20,460
The storm in the Far East is extremely fast

4
00:00:20,460 --> 00:00:21,460
Also good at climbing

5
00:00:21,460 --> 00:00:23,460
Turning around and running will only make you die faster

6
00:00:23,460 --> 00:00:25,460
It's better to rely on the gun in your hand.

7
00:00:25,460 --> 00:00:28,750
It looks like this Far Eastern Bao was injured and broke off the chain.

8
00:00:28,750 --> 00:00:29,750
I ran here and gave birth to a baby.

9
00:00:29,750 --> 00:00:32,750
No wonder that lonely man just let the tiger eat the prey

10
00:00:32,750 --> 00:00:34,750
It looks like the fox is covered in urine.

11
00:00:34,750 --> 00:00:35,750
Help him stay away from other busy tasks outside

12
00:00:35,750 --> 00:00:37,750
This is meeting the real-life version of Hu Jiahu

13
00:00:37,750 --> 00:00:38,750
So powerful

14
00:00:38,750 --> 00:00:39,750
If one shot kills him

15
00:00:39,750 --> 00:00:40,750
Eight horses sold for money

16
00:00:40,750 --> 00:00:42,750
Enough to feed the whole family for several months

17
00:00:42,750 --> 00:00:43,750
But I have a system

18
00:00:43,750 --> 00:00:45,750
The Far Eastern guy who does a good job is favored

19
00:00:45,750 --> 00:00:50,060
Worth much more than a piece of skin

20
00:00:50,060 --> 00:00:51,060
I mean no harm

21
00:00:51,060 --> 00:00:57,060
These things can heal your legs

22
00:00:57,060 --> 00:00:58,060
Look at my face

23
00:00:58,060 --> 00:01:08,090
He looks like a good person at first glance

24
00:01:08,090 --> 00:01:09,090
The child's matter is not urgent

25
00:01:09,090 --> 00:01:10,090
Do business first

26
00:01:10,090 --> 00:01:18,350
Can you survive the infection?

27
00:01:18,350 --> 00:01:20,900
It depends on your own life

28
00:01:20,900 --> 00:01:21,900
I'll think of a way later

29
00:01:21,900 --> 00:01:28,880
Get some antibiotics

30
00:01:28,880 --> 00:01:29,910
Don't worry

31
00:01:29,910 --> 00:01:30,910
Since I decided to help you

32
00:01:30,910 --> 00:01:32,980
I won't ignore this little guy

33
00:01:32,980 --> 00:01:38,910
Let him grow up safely

34
00:01:38,910 --> 00:01:52,500
What's wrong with you, you loser dog?

35
00:01:52,500 --> 00:01:53,500
Your uncle

36
00:01:53,500 --> 00:02:12,420
How much hatred does this have against me?

37
00:02:12,420 --> 00:02:14,420
Fortunately, I was wearing the boss's Madara uniform pants.

38
00:02:14,420 --> 00:02:15,460
Not pierced by pig hair

39
00:02:15,460 --> 00:02:16,460
Although I was raped by a wild boar in my previous life

40
00:02:16,460 --> 00:02:17,460
Fell to death from the top of a cliff

41
00:02:17,460 --> 00:02:18,460
But facing this thing

42
00:02:18,460 --> 00:02:20,460
It's a bit amazing anyway

43
00:02:20,460 --> 00:02:21,460
Two hind legs with pork suet

44
00:02:21,460 --> 00:02:22,460
7 rabbits and 2 pheasants

45
00:02:22,460 --> 00:02:23,460
Add another leopard cub

46
00:02:23,460 --> 00:02:26,310
Feeling numb today

47
00:02:26,310 --> 00:02:27,310
Don’t rely on it. It’s not over yet.
